 Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"l5RR424DtNZg6mDcvrAixw","review_id":"-YP9yDTbGgJP616LPZamnQ","date":"2018-01-24T22:43:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9220923185348511,"text_excerpt":"Love that there are open late. Caught them after a pelicans game, there was no one in the spot food arrived very fast. We got the seafood beignets which were very tasty. Its not loaded with seafood tho i think it could use a bit mor. The burgers were really good tho nice size patty well seasoned. Definitely good enough to make a second trip. Place os very small on the inside maybe 3 tables and a few tables are located right out front on the outside. Its also located next to a bar I'm sure they get some business from them as well."},{"business_id":"l5RR424DtNZg6mDcvrAixw","review_id":"UbuoPy579QfEWJ0gDdEt3Q","date":"2015-11-15T03:08:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9167016744613647,"text_excerpt":"The grade of meat they use for their 8 oz burgers is excellent. Their fries, which are not included with the burgers, are some of the best I have eaten. Well worth the additional cost. The sautéed onions are great. The chicken and sausage gumbo is very good and seasoned very well. All of their soups come single serving or share-with-a-friend sizes. The seafood platter was fried of course but overall tasty. It included fish, oysters and some exceptionally tasty shrimp. You can choose 2 sides. Our takeout order today was for 5 people yet it was ready in just 40 minutes (there was another large order ahead of us). You can step next door to the bar and grab a cold one while you wait. If you t..."},{"business_id":"l5RR424DtNZg6mDcvrAixw","review_id":"YvUPzfk0ZIRNgv9NdTSIvA","date":"2017-03-26T02:08:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9151661396026611,"text_excerpt":"I thought the food was pretty good, but it was highlighted by the girl working the front. We had the fried cheese app, grilled Mahi-mahi tacos, fried oyster po boy, and a Cuban. Ate half of the Cuban, and a few of the oysters. They were really good, with the right bread it would have been perfect. I think the Cuban would have been on point if there was less pork and more ham/salami & cheese. Didn't get a chance to try the tacos, but sure they were ok. I can't eat fish tacos unless they're like Tijuana/Ensenada. (Beer batter, pico, corn tortillas). I just remember thinking over and over- the place is really small, but if I walked in there from parlay's after midnight it would be super incr..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"l5RR424DtNZg6mDcvrAixw","photo_id":"Kw2ilIi9tF65ZAmo_aRLfw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Kw2ilIi9tF65ZAmo_aRLfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8749151229858398},{"business_id":"l5RR424DtNZg6mDcvrAixw","photo_id":"WbBllZ9RWSJGibmAGbS3Rg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/WbBllZ9RWSJGibmAGbS3Rg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8526992797851562},{"business_id":"l5RR424DtNZg6mDcvrAixw","photo_id":"fUzk0yYbeG_5l93L6JM9-w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/fUzk0yYbeG_5l93L6JM9-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8512403964996338},{"business_id":"l5RR424DtNZg6mDcvrAixw","photo_id":"J5BsbzMxl-RNpmwYwmP8lA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/J5BsbzMxl-RNpmwYwmP8lA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7885806560516357}]},"notebook_case":null}
